Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.29,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 55S\fs48\c&H595F65&\bord1\3a&H60&\3c&H000000&\pos(1165.953,711.667)}9.10.11.12月刊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.29,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an6\fnHYQiHei 55S\fs48\c&H3C3A49&\bord1\3a&H60&\3c&H000000&\pos(490,915)}高收入，女性优待
